{"step_index":83,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T02:55:46Z","thinking":"The application structure is defined. The `AppProvider` establishes the context. Within the main layout component, a sidebar and content area are present. The content area includes a header and a container that dynamically renders pages based on the active tab, specifically `HRPage`, `TasksPage`, `GanttPage`, or `DashboardPage`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React from 'react';\\nimport { AppProvider, useApp } from './context/AppContext';\\nimport Sidebar from './components/layout/Sidebar';\\nimport Header from './components/layout/Header';\\nimport Toast from './components/layout/Toast';\\nimport HRPage from './modules/hr/HRPage';\\nimport TasksPage from './modules/tasks/TasksPage';\\nimport GanttPage from './modules/gantt/GanttPage';\\nimport DashboardPage from './modules/dashboard/DashboardPage';\\n\\nfunction MainLayout() {\\n  const { activeTab, sidebarCollapsed } = useApp();\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 flex flex-col transition-colors duration-200\\\">\\n      \\n      {/* 1. Sidebar bên trái (Collapsible trên Desktop & Drawer trên Mobile) */}\\n      <Sidebar />\\n\\n      {/* 2. Khung nội dung chính tự căn chỉnh theo kích thước Sidebar */}\\n      <div\\n        className={`flex-1 flex flex-col transition-all duration-300 ${\\n          sidebarCollapsed ? 'lg:ml-20' : 'lg:ml-72'\\n        }`}\\n      >\\n        {/* Header trên cùng (Đồng hồ số thời gian thực, Chọn ngày, Light/Dark mode) */}\\n        <Header />\\n\\n        {/* Nội dung trang theo từng phân hệ */}\\n        <main className=\\\"flex-1 p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto animate-fade-in\\\">\\n          {activeTab === 'hr' && <HRPage />}\\n          {activeTab === 'tasks' && <TasksPage />}\\n          {activeTab === 'gantt' && <GanttPage />}\\n          {activeTab === 'dashboard' && <DashboardPage />}\\n        </main>\\n\\n        {/* Footer ghi nhận bản quyền APS Việt Nam */}\\n        <footer className=\\\"py-4 px-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-center text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n          <p>© 2026 CÔNG TY GIẢI PHÁP CHÂU Á THÁI BÌNH DƯƠNG VIỆT NAM (APS VIỆT NAM) - CỔNG QUẢN LÝ DỰ ÁN & NHÂN SỰ CÔNG TRƯỜNG</p>\\n        </footer>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Thông báo dạng Toast nổi bật */}\\n      <Toast />\\n\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\\\n<truncated 117 bytes>","Description":"\"Assemble App with AppProvider, Sidebar, Header, dynamic tabs, and Toast\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\GiaWyy\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\aps-project-manager\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\App.jsx\"","toolAction":"\"Updating App.jsx\"","toolSummary":"\"Update App.jsx\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
